<Layout>
	<Header />
    <h1>Services</h1>
    <p>We provide a range of services to support ex-servicemen and their families. Our services include legal assistance, counseling, and advocacy for veterans' rights. We also offer resources for career development and educational opportunities.</p>
    <p>Our team of dedicated professionals is committed to helping ex-servicemen navigate the challenges they face after leaving the military. We work closely with government agencies, non-profit organizations, and community partners to ensure that our clients receive the support they need.</p>
